WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.656
In Clips, the pads are a four by four window. The top row is scene one. Pad thirteen launches its drum clip.

2
00:00:06.735 --> 00:00:12.672
Pad fourteen brings in the bass. Each column is a track, so you can build things up one part at a time.

3
00:00:12.672 --> 00:00:19.145
Pad nine switches the drums to the next scene. Watch the queued state: the change lands on the launch grid.

4
00:00:19.145 --> 00:00:24.094
Press the playing clip's pad again to stop that track. You can leave the other parts running.

5
00:00:24.094 --> 00:00:31.912
Press the data dial to launch the whole selected scene. Empty slots stop their tracks, so a scene can be a breakdown too.

6
00:00:31.912 --> 00:00:37.165
Plus and minus move the pad window four scenes at a time. Press Stop to finish the jam.
